<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-31T13:46:28.531Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified cross-border attacks, striking Saudi airports, oil facilities, and launching drones toward Mecca and Medina that Saudi air defenses intercepted, while missiles were also intercepted over Riyadh. Saudi air strikes in Yemen killed 12 civilians in a residential area and fighting continues near Taiz, where hospitals are buckling under intensified combat. New displacement figures show 290,000 Yemenis forced to move, including pregnant women at risk, and Houthis have attacked Aden airport and the presidential palace, with missiles falling in Aden. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPUnhpZVZHQUliUnJIQUJWb3JmbVl6VV9GZ3NJN0M3X0EzZU9pa2N4SEcybGNlakZkcmxyeVNqV0E5LWRxTU1VZUM4Uk9TdGZTS0RJLU1CZ1JVVFBlM0pTcWFPd2U0b1RFTkVyV2oxSzNwZzYzMjBwVmRtbUFvWUowS1RPSEQ3eE1Qa2ZQQVJ5SExsbzVXQTQtNlZYRC1Bbnh2YmpnZ2VGaHZLQlJDRWJRZEZOU2VCZ1hPcENQcTUtYw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwwFBVV95cUxPdmVaOE5WSkVDd2cxRjFDMmp3T3NHV0xXM1hBLUtzd3hZVzFiWS1MMnUwTWYtTC1QX2JkQTZmM09lNE9VOFpHRmRWOWNGMjZ4d0F4akJMMWRKLUlhcWMzTjZtSlBWdVZiWWpuNXhobkY1c212Q3c4SXVZc2c2dFhhT2RVV2NHY3NjampzU1g5ZUNjOTJ4TXI0eUdGTXVpNGEwMWRkaXNNU3lNd3FVOFR2M1RJR1hHaTRDN2FpaWtxRVdfV3M?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBjLWpfN